{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2543,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "mattexe.bossnotifier",
  "name": "BossNotifier ",
  "slug": "bossnotifier",
  "teaser": "v1.1.1 out now! Know which bosses spawned in your raid! Get notifications at spawn with locations.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/e9MHWhhcpEeyeajgVdlihQ8vjniqjtoCGYonfUCk.png",
  "downloads": 41515,
  "favourites_count": 114,
  "description": "<h1>BossNotifier</h1>\n<p>Know your enemies before they know you! BossNotifier alerts you to boss spawns at raid start and displays real-time 3D markers above their heads.</p>\n<p><strong>Supported Bosses:</strong> Reshala, Tagilla, Killa, Glukhar, Shturman, Sanitar, Zryachiy, Kaban, Kollontay, Partisan, Goons, Cultists, Rogues, Blood Hounds, Santa Claus, Punisher, Legion</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">📖 Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Notifications</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Get notified which bosses spawned when the raid begins</li>\n<li>See where bosses spawned (e.g., “Reshala has been located near Dormitory”)</li>\n<li>Get alerted when you enter a boss’s vicinity (✓ checkmark)</li>\n<li>Press <strong>O</strong> anytime to see current boss locations</li>\n<li>Lock features behind Intel Center levels for progression</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3D Markers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Floating markers above boss heads that update in real-time</li>\n<li>Show/hide distance and boss name</li>\n<li>Full RGB color customization</li>\n<li>Option to only show markers when you can see the boss</li>\n<li>Press <strong>P</strong> to toggle markers on/off</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">⚙️ Configuration</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>All settings configurable via <strong>F12</strong> menu:</p>\n<p><strong>General</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keyboard Shortcut (default: O)</li>\n<li>Show Bosses on Raid Start</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Intel Center Unlocks</strong> <em>(set to 4 to disable)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Notification unlock level</li>\n<li>Location unlock level</li>\n<li>Detection unlock level</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Boss Markers</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable/Disable markers</li>\n<li>Toggle markers key (default: P)</li>\n<li>Show through walls</li>\n<li>Customizable marker: ▼ ▽ ↓ ● ◆ ★ ⚠ ☠ ◉ ▲</li>\n<li>Show boss name</li>\n<li>Show distance</li>\n<li>Font size</li>\n<li>Base/Max scale</li>\n<li>Visibility distance</li>\n<li>Marker color</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">📥 Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download the latest release</li>\n<li>Extract the archive</li>\n<li>Copy <code>BepInEx</code> folder to your SPT directory</li>\n<li>Start the game and configure via <strong>F12</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code>SPT/\n└── BepInEx/\n    └── plugins/\n        └── BossNotifier.dll\n</code></pre></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">🎮 Fika Sync</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Playing with Fika?</strong> Install the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/27/bossnotifier-fika-sync-addon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BossNotifier - Fika Sync Addon</a> for multiplayer support!</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Boss locations sync from host to all clients</li>\n<li>Boss death status syncs to all players</li>\n<li>Press <strong>O</strong> on any client to see boss notifications</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Both <strong>host AND clients</strong> need:\n<ul>\n<li>BossNotifier  v1.1.1+ (this mod)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/27/bossnotifier-fika-sync-addon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BossNotifier - Fika Sync Addon</a></li>\n<li>Fika 2.1.0+</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">⚠️ Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>None so far</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Found a bug? Report it in the comments!</em></p></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<p>If you enjoy what I do buy me a coffee <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/dr3vik\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ko-fi.com/dr3vik</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>PLEASE NOTE THAT I AM NOT THE ORIGINAL AUTHOR OF THIS MOD. ALL CREDITS GOES TO <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/41131/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mattdokn</a> - THE ORIGINAL CREATOR OF THIS MOD</strong></p>\n",
