      "description": "<h2>⚠️ HOTFIX</h2>\n<p>Fixed crash for non-Fika users.</p>\n<h3>🐛 Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed Fika code that was causing SPT to fail loading for users without Fika installed</li>\n<li><strong>Goons markers</strong>: Big Pipe and Birdeye now display 3D markers correctly (previously only Knight had a marker)</li>\n<li><strong>Dead boss notification</strong>: Pressing O after killing a boss now shows “eliminated ☠” instead of “located”</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>✨ New</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fika Sync Addon</strong>: Multiplayer support is now available as a separate addon! <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/27/bossnotifier-fika-sync-addon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Download here</a>\n<ul>\n<li>Syncs boss locations from host to all clients</li>\n<li>Syncs boss death status to all players</li>\n<li>Both host and clients need the addon installed</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📋 Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.x</li>\n<li>Fika 2.1.0+ (only if using the Fika Sync Addon)</li>\n</ul>\n",
